WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:05.172
A Pareto frontier is not a deployment.

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:10.660
VLLM's PD recipes for a 2.4T model on GB300 NVL72.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.850
GPUs behind each headline number.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:17.529
The 5,000 end, 48; the 180 end, 16.

00:00:17.529 --> 00:00:22.589
Different topologies; MTP off at one end, on at the other.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:31.079
Tokens per second per GPU, 8,192 in and 1,024 out.

00:00:31.079 --> 00:00:35.596
Total, the headline, 5,000; generated, 556.

00:00:35.596 --> 00:00:41.619
(8,192 + 1,024) / 1,024 is exactly 9.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:45.519
Not a benchmark but a tuning method, and the method is

00:00:45.519 --> 00:00:46.598
the part worth having.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.858
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
